  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: start;\">열과 관련지어 입자의 운동을 이야기하면서, 운동을 표현해 볼 수 있는 방법을 생각하다.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">예전에 재과만에서 filpaclip 이라는 어플 사용한 수업을 봤던 기억이 나서,</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">3차시로 열의 이동 방식을 학습하고 영상으로 제작해보는 수업을 하였습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7165d3274172f9e4c67d0023f4a1df14087b4162?download\" data-file-name=\"열의 이동방식 플립북 제작.pptx\" data-file-size=\"406890\" data-mimetype=\"application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.presentationml.presentation\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHp%26dataid%3D510%26fileid%3D6%26regdt%3D20241116000444&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F7165d3274172f9e4c67d0023f4a1df14087b4162')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">열의 이동방식 플립북 제작</span><span class=\"type\">.pptx</span></div><div class=\"size\">397.35KB</div></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvz5djb1miya5u3plo5w9oypb@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rvz5djb1miya5u3plo5w9oypb/thumbs/4.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33288656691&amp;signature=dhxr0Fb%2BIS4kx9hQtGvVAGLWDNg%3D&amp;ts=1731747891\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvz5djb1miya5u3plo5w9oypb?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2ejVkamIxbWl5YTV1M3BsbzV3OW95cGIiLCJ0aWQiOiI4Zjc2ZGUzZC0yMmY5LTQ3OTQtODY3NS04MGI1ZjMwYzhhMzgiLCJhcHBfaWQiOi